{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And the earth was filled</b> Two occurrences in the Masorah with ותמלא הארץ: here and the other: ותמלא הארץ אתם. That the earth itself was filled with them — for they would give birth to six in one womb, and they would be swallowed under the ground and afterward sprout up and emerge. And so too the earth itself was filled with חמס (violence) — for one would deposit his pouch with his fellow, and balsam with it, and the depositary would place the pouch with the balsam under the ground with his treasures, and the depositor would come at night and smell the balsam and take everything." "<b>חמס</b> in gematria: מי נח (the waters of Noah) — teaches that He punished them measure for measure. חמס in gematria: גיהנם (Gehenna) — teaches that they were judged in boiling."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:43.710781875Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}